# release-please owns these two files and rewrites them on every release, in a
# style prettier does not accept: "*" list bullets and a blank line after each
# heading in the changelog, no spaces inside the braces of the manifest.
# Upstream carries neither file, so its prettier run never met them; the "other"
# lint job that checks them arrived with the upstream merge. Left unignored, the
# next release pull request fails lint on content no human wrote.
CHANGELOG.md
.github/release-please-manifest.json
